Updated notification hooks to export the typed alert payloads, save typed rule inputs/updates, strip id from update request bodies, and send typed alert test targets.
Updated settings helper signatures and the API barrel exports for the new alert types.
Updated admin AlertRule type to the typed backend rule contract and removed legacy alert-rule fields.
